{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/1-en_US.gif?t=1744987610\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Your Tree, you can create the perfect tree just the way you imagine. Start from a simple seed and watch it grow into a unique, beautiful tree filled with colorful leaves, flowers, and fruits. Every choice you make shapes how your tree looks, from the size of its branches to the colors of its blossoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/2-en_US.gif?t=1744987610\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no time limit and no competition. Immerse yourself in a beautiful and imaginative world that feels like a warm hug. Watch cute animals wandering around, and pet them if you like. Whether for a few minutes or a few hours, it's a place where you can unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/3-en_US.gif?t=1744987610\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also design and decorate the world around your tree. Add charming decorations such as lanterns, benches, and little animal friends to bring the surroundings to life. Whether you prefer a bright and lively space or a quiet, starlit night, the world around your tree is yours to shape. It's more than just building a tree, it's also creating your own peaceful oasis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3133020?t=1744987610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744987610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/adb177ab7c83b365eabefc4b5b19e17748e7270d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744987610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/adb177ab7c83b365eabefc4b5b19e17748e7270d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744987610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/1-en_US.gif?t=1744987610\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Your Tree, you can create the perfect tree just the way you imagine. Start from a simple seed and watch it grow into a unique, beautiful tree filled with colorful leaves, flowers, and fruits. Every choice you make shapes how your tree looks, from the size of its branches to the colors of its blossoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/2-en_US.gif?t=1744987610\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no time limit and no competition. Immerse yourself in a beautiful and imaginative world that feels like a warm hug. Watch cute animals wandering around, and pet them if you like. Whether for a few minutes or a few hours, it's a place where you can unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/3-en_US.gif?t=1744987610\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also design and decorate the world around your tree. Add charming decorations such as lanterns, benches, and little animal friends to bring the surroundings to life. Whether you prefer a bright and lively space or a quiet, starlit night, the world around your tree is yours to shape. It's more than just building a tree, it's also creating y